     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Bouldering joins a climbing frame and a swing set in one structure. Children climb a ladder net to a raised net deck and leave by a purple and turquoise slide. Swing beams on either side carry belt swings, a nest swing hangs under the deck, and a row of hanging stepping pods and a ring traverse add more to try. It is listed for 50 to 55 children. The product area is 29'7\" x 25'9\". Allow a safe play area of 35'7\" x 31'9\", which leaves room for the swings to move. Skills it builds include problem solving, creative thinking and strength. A township park or a school that wants swings and climbing without buying two pieces should look at it. Warranty is 3 years on its galvanised pipe, moulded parts, laminates and rope. Ask us for a quote with the safe zone drawn in."
     }
